r20_theorem.py  instance set 'medium_a'  crosscheck=False orbits=False reduce_orders=False
loop-energy functions:
  H1_stack_only                [H] stack -1, everything else 0
  H2_penalties                 [H] stack -3; bulge 2+u; interior 3+u; multiloop 4+k+u; exterior 0
  H3_hash_0to9                 [H] stack -5; bulge/interior/multi: pseudo-random integer in 0..9 (crc32 of the loop, seed 1)
  H4_hash_0to3                 [H] stack -2; bulge/interior/multi: pseudo-random integer in 0..3 (seed 2)
  H5_boundary_zero             [H] stack -7; bulge/interior/multi exactly 0 (boundary of H2)
  GEN1_H2star_delta1           [GEN] (H2*) with delta=1: every bulge/interior/multiloop has energy sigma*b(f)+1 < 0 (b = item bonds on it); prediction: S1, S3-S5 unchanged, S2 with gap min(|sigma|,delta)=1
  GEN2_H2star_mixed            [GEN] bulge with b>=2 item bonds: sigma*(b-1); bulge with b=1: -1; interior/multi: sigma*b+3; prediction gap 3
  GEN3_coax_weaker             [GEN] stack -2; flush nick (coaxial stack) kappa=-1 with sigma<kappa<=0; other loops 0; prediction: E* = sigma*M + kappa*(n-m), gap kappa-sigma = 1, minimisers = tilings
  GEN4_coax_equal_bulge_pos    [GEN] stack -2; flush nick -2 (coaxial stack as strong as a stack); bulge/interior/multi +1; prediction (for B>=2): E* = sigma*m*(B-1), gap min(|sigma|,1) = 1, minimisers = tilings
  GEN5_dangles_small           [GEN] stack -3; exterior loops: -1 per unpaired base covalently next to a pair ('some dangles'); other 0; prediction (|sigma| > D_G + D_C = 2): E* = sigma*M + d*(m-1), gap |sigma|-2 = 1, minimisers = tilings
  GEN6_exterior_constant       [GEN] stack -3; EVERY exterior loop -2 (a constant): energies shift by -2c for all structures; the entry E* omits the shift on purpose, see the special handling (shift = -2*(n+1))
  CTRL1_H0_coax_equal          [CTRL] (H0) dropped: a flush nick ('stack across a nick') gets sigma=-1; bulge/interior/multi 0
  CTRL2_H2_bulge_as_stack      [CTRL] (H2) dropped: every bulge gets sigma=-1
  CTRL3_H1_sigma_zero          [CTRL] (H1) dropped: sigma = 0 (all loops 0)
  CTRL4_H2star_delta0          [CTRL] (H2*) at delta=0: bulge/interior/multi get sigma*b(f)
  CTRL5_dangles_large          [CTRL] (H0) dropped: 'dangles' of -2 per base with |sigma|=3 < D_G+D_C=4; tested against the GEN5 prediction E* = sigma*M + d*(m-1) (minimisers = tilings), which must fail

